            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 4,
              "start": 4
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Matthew S. Hellman, the statute\u2019s language was borrowed from a provision that prohibited obstruction of a pending proceeding, suggesting a narrow rather than all\u2011purpose tax crime."
